OL,3,GNEWSABurnham wants Neets report to be
OL,4,Awatershed moment, No 10 says, as Tories
OL,5,Acriticise welfare and tax proposals
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe proposes that under-25s should no
OL,8,Flonger be able to claim the health
OL,9,Felement of universal credit; businesses
OL,10,Fshould be taxed less for employing
OL,11,Fyoung people; and public and private
OL,12,Fsector employers should hire more
OL,13,Fapprentices
OL,15,FSpeaking for the government, Work and
OL,16,FPensions Secretary Pat McFadden calls
OL,17,Fthe report a "radical blueprint" - it's
OL,18,Fclear he agrees with it, writes our
OL,19,Fcorrespondent
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
